# App Review Information: goes to Apple only, never public. notes.txt carries
# the reviewer API key, the rest is personal contact data (name, email, phone,
# demo account). The public store listing under ios/fastlane/metadata/<locale>/
# stays tracked; its source of truth is metadata/app_store/*.md, regenerated
# locally by script/sync_store_metadata.sh.
